{"id":"521559872","kind":"article","title":"学券","author":"Piotr Wozniak","original_authors":["Piotr Wozniak"],"original_source_urls":["https://supermemo.guru/wiki/School_voucher"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"学校教育问题","date":"2022-05-29","updated":"2026-10-27","votes":12,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":373,"keywords":["教育券","学校选择","自由教育","教育政策"],"summary":"词条将学券定义为政府资助的教育凭证，使学生可选择学校或教育形式；并简述 Milton Friedman 提出现代学券方案的背景及其与学校选择、自由教育的关系。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/521559872","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"SJIy7xvs\"><b>学券</b>或<b>教育券</b>是一种政府资助的教育证券。学生可以<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/School_choice\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">选择学校</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>或他的教育形式，并以<b>学券</b>支付费用。Milton Friedman 在 1955 年提出这个想法的现代版，作为促进<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/School_choice\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">学校选择</a>和<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Freedom_of_education\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">自由教育</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>的工具。到 2017 年，约有 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.edchoice.org/school_choice_faqs/how-does-school-choice-work-in-other-countries/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">25 个国家</a>采用了某种形式的凭证制度。来自世界银行的比较分析可参见<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Voucher_system:_promising_solutions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">这里</a>。</p><p data-pid=\"zrMTqbRU\">另见：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"lt5NtiN2\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Grand_Education_Reform\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">教育改革</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"E5zY0ZFl\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Carl_Bereiter:_Must_we_educate\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Carl Bereiter：我们要教育吗</a><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"LI1s1IF2\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/School_voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">维基百科：学券</a></li></ul><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"RQqwErQ4\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制 <br/>题图：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.pixiv.net/artworks/95137837\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">#アサルトリリィ 【skeb】ウエディングたかなほ - モルゲン的插画 - pixiv</a> <br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/School_voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">School voucher - supermemo.guru</a><br/>本<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Glossary\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">术语</a>条目用于解释《<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Problem_of_Schooling\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">我永远不会送我的孩子去学校</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup>》<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-5\"><a href=\"#ref-5\">[5]</a></sup>(2017) 作者：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Piotr_Wozniak\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Piotr Wozniak</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-6\"><a href=\"#ref-6\">[6]</a></sup></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 择校 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"540026307\" href=\"#/post/540026307\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 关于教育自由和信息自由 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"351348580\" href=\"#/post/351348580\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 教育改革 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"242815901\" href=\"#/post/242815901\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-4\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-4\">↩</a> 《我永远不会送我的孩子去学校》 <a href=\"http://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/73383015\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">http://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/73383015</a></li><li id=\"ref-5\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-5\">↩</a> 学校教育的问题 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"611469462\" href=\"#/post/611469462\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-6\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-6\">↩</a> 彼得 · 沃兹尼亚克 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"303204832\" href=\"#/post/303204832\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"520591051","title":"普鲁士的纪律不可避免地摧毁了教育","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":1281,"minutes":6,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 学校教育问题"},{"id":"521885826","title":"将创造力与 ADHD 混淆","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":288,"minutes":26,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 学校教育问题"},{"id":"351348580","title":"关于教育自由和信息自由","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":85,"minutes":18,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"611469462","title":"学校教育的问题","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":446,"minutes":10,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"303204832","title":"彼得 · 沃兹尼亚克","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":70,"minutes":9,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[],"rec_answers":[{"id":"3040571508","title":"UBI（Universal basic income，全民基本收入）可行吗？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":544,"minutes":30,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 544 赞同","evidence":"回答正文有明确指向该译文的知乎内链/链接卡，按直接提及记为1级。"},{"id":"3029922725","title":"为什么，所有人都在骂应试教育，却没有人有实际的办法？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":310,"minutes":34,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 310 赞同","evidence":"该目标标题/关键词链接随回答中被摘录的来源文章带入；只确认标题提及，不把摘录段落中携带的链接周边内容算作对目标译文的独立化用。锚点：「学券」。"},{"id":"1926248931551088800","title":"假设把教育改革大权交到你手中，你将做点什么？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":142,"minutes":3,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 142 赞同","evidence":"逐对核对后，回答锚点“学券”与目标译文标题或唯一关键词相符。"},{"id":"2803361222","title":"如何评价无条件基本收入（Unconditional Basic income）？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":113,"minutes":29,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 113 赞同","evidence":"复核了对